design/ecad/band/band-interface.md:145: 1. The tail is 1.8 wide at the neck, not 1.4 (thin.py line 66 `tail_w=1.4`, `tail_x=-2.6`, slot 2.0 wide). Reason: the FLEX1 neck carries 5 lines on B.Cu (0.08 lines at 0.10 gaps, one 0.20 ground) and 2 on F.Cu; the usable width is the width minus 2 x 0.
